    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================================================================== -->
<!-- 01 · OUR STORY                                                       -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__aside">
        <p class="kicker kicker--label"><span class="kicker__slash">//</span> Our story</p>
        <h2 class="split__title rv" id="s1-title">From Software Engineering to Security-First Thinking</h2>
        <div class="split__prose">
          <p class="rv">CipherTrivia was born inside Nextwebi IT Solutions, a software engineering company that has spent 15+ years building products for clients across 20+ countries. Years of shipping applications taught us where security gaps actually come from: rushed releases, misconfigured cloud environments, and assumptions that "someone else" is testing for vulnerabilities.</p>
          <p class="rv">We built CipherTrivia to be that "someone else": a focused cybersecurity practice that combines hands-on penetration testing experience with the AI-assisted analysis needed to keep pace with modern attack surfaces.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body">
        <ol class="deliver__list">
          <li class="deliver__item rv">
            {{ icon("code") }}
            <div>
              <h3 class="deliver__title">Engineering-led security</h3>
              <p class="deliver__text">Our team has built and shipped software, so we know how vulnerabilities actually get introduced.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="deliver__item rv">
            {{ icon("globe") }}
            <div>
              <h3 class="deliver__title">Global delivery experience</h3>
              <p class="deliver__text">Backed by Nextwebi's 20+ country client base and established delivery processes.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="deliver__item rv">
            {{ icon("badge") }}
            <div>
              <h3 class="deliver__title">Certified processes</h3>
              <p class="deliver__text">ISO 9001 (Quality Management) and ISO 27001 (Information Security) certified.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================================================================== -->
<!-- 02 · MISSION & VALUES                                                -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta">
        <p class="kicker kicker--label"><span class="kicker__slash">//</span> Mission &amp; values</p>
      </div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">What Drives How We Work</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our mission is simple: help businesses ship software with confidence by finding the security gaps before attackers do, and explaining them in language your team can act on.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="principles principles--4">
      <article class="principle rv">
        {{ icon("shield-check") }}
        <h3 class="principle__title">Integrity</h3>
        <p class="principle__text">Honest reporting: every finding, every risk level, no inflated severity to justify a sale.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="principle rv" style="--d:1">
        {{ icon("target") }}
        <h3 class="principle__title">Precision</h3>
        <p class="principle__text">Methodology-driven testing aligned to OWASP, PTES and NIST SP 800-115 (repeatable, not ad-hoc).</p>
      </article>
      <article class="principle rv" style="--d:2">
        {{ icon("bolt") }}
        <h3 class="principle__title">Speed without shortcuts</h3>
        <p class="principle__text">AI-assisted triage helps us cover more ground quickly, with human validation on every critical finding.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="principle rv" style="--d:3">
        {{ icon("link") }}
        <h3 class="principle__title">Partnership</h3>
        <p class="principle__text">We work with your developers to fix issues, not just hand over a PDF and disappear.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================================================================== -->
<!-- 03 · CERTIFICATIONS & STANDARDS                                      -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s3-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta">
        <p class="kicker kicker--label"><span class="kicker__slash">//</span> Certifications &amp; standards</p>
      </div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s3-title">Backed by Recognized Standards</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our processes and testing methodology are aligned to internationally recognized frameworks.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="standards standards--icons">
      <div class="standard rv">{{ icon("badge") }}<p class="standard__name">ISO 9001</p><p class="standard__area">Quality Management</p></div>
      <div class="standard rv" style="--d:1">{{ icon("lock") }}<p class="standard__name">ISO 27001</p><p class="standard__area">Information Security</p></div>
      <div class="standard rv" style="--d:2">{{ icon("target") }}<p class="standard__name">OWASP &amp; PTES</p><p class="standard__area">Testing Methodology</p></div>
      <div class="standard rv" style="--d:3">{{ icon("clipboard") }}<p class="standard__name">NIST SP 800-115</p><p class="standard__area">Security Assessment Guidelines</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

